  "limitations": [
    "Parent epic: EPIC-006. Planning only; no tests, implementation, review or verification completed by this decomposition.",
    "Specification v0.45 §10. Synthetic typed chat commands preserve exact message and sender identity, current complete route authorization, optional omission, cooldowns and bounded process-local replay. There is no catalog migration.",
    "75B evicts only replay terminals and preserves running cooldowns. 76B admits on either complete route with the linked individual or role deny veto in combined mode. A complete category permit can admit with linked facts unavailable. On the linked-only route, C8 omits a denied optional action and keeps the permitted action and response.",
    "A007-I1 records the first positional typed binding fault. A reached grammar failure records an invalid_arguments terminal, samples time and takes a FIFO slot without starting cooldown. A reached local input_limit exception publishes nothing. The frozen contract leaves mixed local faults unordered. Allocation rollback and the unreachable numeric helper exception paths were reviewed in source.",
    "The exact admitted Stage 1 baseline has 37 evaluator NI stops, two constructor failures covering 2 + 8 missing typed refusals, and two passing permission controls. The exact Stage 2 product parent passes all 41 methods directly and under CTest, plus 33 + 32 + 55 unchanged control methods, without skips. Retained hashes and loader reconciliation bind the local pre-promotion runs.",
    "Promotion configure removes the intentional-red registration label and the required hosted Core job runs the same 41 named cases, with 649/649 overall. All seven checks passed on the reviewed promotion head. Proof-head required checks and protected merge are separate.",
    "AUTH-06 and AUTH-07 remain partial. #337 owns live receipt binding and restart-spanning intake deduplication. Actual action and response delivery stays with owning services."
  ],
